PATH RESOLUTION (no silent drift)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The generated prompt's "Output" names apps/apple/TeslaSync/Features/Admin/ — that is
the generator's template default. The real Apple app compiles the `Sources/` group
(project.yml: `- path: Sources`), every sibling P7 admin page lives in
apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/ (ApiPlayground, AuditLog, FeatureFlags, …), and the
ApiPlayground predecessor committed there. SwiftLint's `included:` list is `Sources`,
not `TeslaSync/Features`. Following the established, buildable convention, the unit ships
to apps/apple/Sources/Features/Admin/ (tests → apps/apple/Tests/Unit/Features/Admin/),
so the file is actually compiled, linted and tested. Navigation registration touched:
Sources/App/AppRoute.swift + Sources/TeslaSyncApp.swift. Strings → Localization/
Localizable.xcstrings. Ledger → apps/parity/apple-ledger.json.

