ARCHITECTURE (ADR-002/004/005/006/011/014/015)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  • SwiftUI View + @MainActor @Observable APIKeysPageModel; zero networking in the view
    (reads/writes through the injectable APIKeysDataSource seam → KMP core in production).
  • Four data hooks ported with the same call-site names through the seam:
      useApiKeys      → loadKeys()      (GET    /api-keys)
      useCreateApiKey → createKey()     (POST   /api-keys)        → returns one-time secret
      useDeleteApiKey → deleteKey(id:)  (DELETE /api-keys/{id})
      useRevokeApiKey → revokeKey(id:)  (POST   /api-keys/{id}/revoke)
  • Adaptive macOS (regular) + iOS (compact/regular): metadata reflows via ViewThatFits;
    create/delete are HIG sheets; macOS sheets get a min frame.
  • Tokens only (Color.TS / Font.TS / TSSpacing / TSRadius), shared P3 components
    (TSGlassPanel, TSButton, TSBadge-style chips, TSEmptyState, TSErrorDisplay, TSSkeleton,
    TSTextField, TSSelect, TSMaskedValue, TSCopyButton); no raw glass, no hardcoded color.
  • No charts, no map (manifest declares none).
  • Not a live/SSE source → no staleness indicator (ADR-013 N/A).
  • a11y: panel/row contain-elements + labels, badge combine, VoiceOver labels on Revoke/
    Delete/Copy/reveal, .help tooltips on macOS, Dynamic Type via tokens, light/dark via
    dynamic color tokens.
  • i18n: every visible literal via LocalizedStringKey / String(localized:); zero hardcoded.

